{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3207a84868c9856a05337053969479d4b8ba27de6020c39a9738c074ba47ee",
      "text": "传达吧，应援！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa195ddeff1f8376abc74059f56ebabca1a69cf70418ba5ce26a75a54649000b",
      "text": "FRAME确定将在早间新闻节目中担任为期1个月的\n主题曲演唱者。不仅如此，\n他们还决定客串出演各个环节，\n干劲十足的3人为迎接正式演出展开了练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3207a84868c9856a05337053969479d4b8ba27de6020c39a9738c074ba47ee",
      "text": "传达吧，应援！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae3d0b4dd59a08740a8a94acfcde8cf9392cc4aeb12dc0adc6dbd3b26a3e5b7c",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ad4705a09969cbc7e0e30640cc2a7384bef998d1c6bea51dbc5d5cf43b3bf4e",
      "text": "呼，流了身好汗啊。\n信玄、龙，训练辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35ae3a1762fadddbfe3a5dcdc6db572278b0b9561ea657fc25a5eb2761853f1d",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n等下是要去电视台开会来着吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0b87bc19b0f810f6a28fa22cee5e4a2b435c24b69235bf1d21cc8bb8aa2b45",
      "text": "嗯。真没想到我们居然能在早间新闻节目里\n连续1个月担任主题曲的演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5432060a85cee1982491932ca0f14c479d8ad48fadce61a6cf98d81d4c39f6be",
      "text": "而且，还要在演播厅进行现场演唱对吧？\n听●●●●プロデューサー说起的时候我还真吃了一惊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e07857b7324a72eb10e6e5696fdc9a49fa4a86cd4a265319a938942c54a5b0",
      "text": "这是一个让更多人认识我们的好机会。\n打起精神大干一场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dedfc4c1f3d3d85bd8ce66af9022190c40355e5c8e0cc87384ef1480982dbe5e",
      "text": "……距离出发时间还有些富余。\n我打算再稍微训练一会儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ad9623c0f4f4d2b27fd0a5b5ce9c3fc64ba3e5829f006be3e7efbeecc20faa4",
      "text": "我也来！\n刚才只是轻度训练而已嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:934ad4d64576dee19c2a90de697a51e4f89a76073fec490583b3f23435e253d5",
      "text": "诶！？刚才那样算轻度……？\n真不愧是前自卫官和前消防员……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21747a6aceda35a4fa7ae89d6940314578e2827fa10b73a6bd8e54857b2dc603",
      "text": "英雄先生不来吗？您还能动得起来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e3bebab5404ec7d00aff3337c6218c06b27bdd57aba4cb7faf2ff4354ec79d1",
      "text": "啊——……也、也是啊。\n稍微陪你们练一会儿倒还可以。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef8ebcf7ecfc00de74446ecc0dbfe35e5ee788fec126918c77ac5c3a3a606fa",
      "text": "电视台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c76657c0944e4f0bbd67db25dd4f79ecd4eb6eca897c71532c93975c11d1a48",
      "text": "今天非常感谢各位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69cbf4abb35cc0017c76902786d5650e3cbcb6933bf124ba7b15ce70005b5e50",
      "text": "哎呀～，今天能聊一聊真是太好了！FRAME那种认真的\n氛围，跟我们这档新闻节目简直是绝配。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b7f5ac14441e4dd2b5d63703a5c1c14e7f441b155923d65cc27c00a881d8ac",
      "text": "而且作为偶像也非常棒！\n感觉能够很好地向年轻群体推广这档节目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab16a6c268355ac005ff8384eec1be173fa12889f57db0c94c4b44f318386561",
      "text": "让我更加确信向你们发出邀请真是没看走眼。\n接下来，我们节目《7 in LIVE！》就拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af78e6406206cae72f88b0c71910dddf6e6af6de7eed6ab2b3a2397e80661f82",
      "text": "好的，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bae02e4ea65b59bae3439db8e3351ac42e60e25dfc5543ca6fedae1f7e44464",
      "text": "能被那么夸奖真是太开心了！\n商谈进行得很顺利真是太好啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7a13f88951013f9da18e1058b4461633d78d82ea6ab523da765a731b195449",
      "text": "受到那么大的期待固然很有压力，\n但这也代表着很有挑战的价值啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2892332e4f2f33a08cbbd1678a35a21252ecc965da182694040d2ea701f392b1",
      "text": "啊啊。回事务所之后，马上开个作战会议吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー，拜托你的协助了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5455b97f1840b10a7356082919667171c587f584ca997415305e1a4de4fc6aa8",
      "text": "当然了。\n我也会全力支持大家的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000085:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000092:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75776b5d09a533e943215fce462b6ec7f4942baddad59ab6346116393a34d6fc",
      "text": "不好意思！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000094:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97446bfe12fb24b98a709558bb7d10e9e57142e7e8f956aaf51da8e4555cfb88",
      "text": "手机电量耗尽了……！\n刚刚才看到\n关于工作的新消息！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000096:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f676eceb661d5c27f1bae383a2aaa3fa9a9aebbec27d4994030356cc75ab6356",
      "text": "我们居然能作为嘉宾出演\n节目的各个环节，\n太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000098:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47158e8fdbf663d6c7139919d13a0988b4a2146da49405fd8155469d8caf2500",
      "text": "龙负责天气预报，\n信玄负责新闻资讯，\n我负责烦恼咨询。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000100:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da43de9655a695c9bf6a1a642ac14e9d0d060518e9da1243fdd67e7cddc6af3",
      "text": "都是跟我们各自的前职业\n多多少少有些关联的\n环节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000102:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c81d3c96c1e29f0d42b30db7e8bea595a024dd8ea20af66537a2236e7840f2a",
      "text": "在各自的环节活跃的同时，\n出演当天还必须\n圆满完成主题曲的现场演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000104:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d253440884e1ce97de74265d5c649765a0bbb3aaade62627563d52ceb2fad1a6",
      "text": "要应对多项任务，\n体力果然才是最关键的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000106:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06f682394f6cf4dd4f1246c0a9d6ca6adcaceb0ec445fa388bd6342cc4f5b2f6",
      "text": "那么从明天开始，立刻增加以\n提高基础体力为目标的\n训练量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000108:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f17e9281db32f5a27a96decedbc23c96c484ef1eb4e352553796bd9d572641",
      "text": "请多注意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000108:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea669ebeeebdde2afc0d2ae3f422fe480d1c27f139770e9929cfcec825b36413",
      "text": "训练的量\n请务必多加注意哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000111:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd23ce0199bf44d52650ad2c37d06b10b9b6146c63bdf28938dc72ce389b521a",
      "text": "啊啊，我知道的。要是量完尺寸的\n服装穿不进去了，\n那可就麻烦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_b:cmd-000113:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f81466685884fd62aad44f6bd55399c95e6fd4812bc2038a8ba2aef39de2595",
      "text": "放心吧，为了避免练过头，\n我会好好盯紧他们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84581cb768543a0c242401c57f7df6fbbed9579012c8a1240ec0055542b8bfb2",
      "text": "……好，汉字抄写完成！诚司先生，\n那份报纸你看完之后能借我看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ef540f31b6d509b837e9248bb196355415891261ab3c5e777bff356047d6c92",
      "text": "没问题。话虽如此，这次重新学习之后，\n新闻用语数量之多着实让我吃了一惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:580e07a497cba99c27e40dce844c0c3326ee01e7a3333b2e1fc810e2f26d59f3",
      "text": "每年新词汇都在不断增加，\n要记的东西也很多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86c5e67d5dc80cba91b0b42d25a05fc7b0169ac9642965845a0db42c967661fb",
      "text": "是啊。不过多亏了学习的成果，感觉比以前更能够\n理解新闻内容了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8916e60f37aaec838f82b8629dc2f573500d71ac36fc46a6987b4a096d8c9815",
      "text": "也开始有意识地去看新闻了……\n要是学生时代的自己知道了，肯定会大吃一惊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73d2a2341368f52ff64ab4fd7e5dadce12c5fe3c56fb5ead5ffae1ba14328ee",
      "text": "英雄先生和诚司先生当年怎么样？\n学生时代会看新闻或报纸吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:369d845532bdf72ce9ada2a28de4183df58207e6108f4221057775c29d533340",
      "text": "看倒是看过，但并没有那么在意过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e600f14bc42d2fe988e01e979a2ed34eadb1826870899552eb235cf2201b997b",
      "text": "我也是。要是早知道将来会上新闻节目，\n那时候一定会更认真念书的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57009fab81e90960a1572c58bcec789d0a717b55c23c1e961c27cd46e60f6e84",
      "text": "现在回想起来，当年其实有不少课程\n对做偶像挺有帮助的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a559de2582e609e0efb4dc7ed55544ced6d79d3c5c66c878cfec73a37aa1f30",
      "text": "（学生时代吗……说起来，一到入学或者分班的\n时节，总会遇到做有趣自我介绍的老师啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_c:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8080520bd58200abcf2b5e412219caff717e9ee0f5c049e46120c07f1367c587",
      "text": "你们两个。\n我稍微想到了一件事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ee159da4c218d2dc73143b4b4afe61c399f52b024cc2ef99b814a55ee7192ba",
      "text": "会议室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4baaf1356f3f70df43aecf6b5fa9bb39c6aa5bbaed465c173729c12d5a08c02",
      "text": "……在节目里自我介绍的时候，要不要想一个\n能吸引观众注意力的专属标语？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:511b1a769c5773b4d6c84a270b2bf4417adc41d2bb4eaaaabc370d7815f871f9",
      "text": "这是个好主意呢！\n感觉能让观众对FRAME留下更深刻的印象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a486130f91541c8f823fb488f0f9517cf246c597ca3a8dd4fff9064c8d35380",
      "text": "说到标语的话，\n果然还是要有冲击力的一句话比较好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cc432dc4442c6b39b4789e25a25b1cd6d333ff9bd16c03b5b32ad50bdd311d4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n要是想到什么点子能不能也告诉我们？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a174608b08c17e836e0b39faa9e0d9b959eef3d4393c45db5c65b01bd524acfa",
      "text": "这个嘛，如果用一句话来介绍的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000056:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:235a268715bc0e61113f1331b3a1f27a3cabc7cedfed48a943f43d0233bbc3c5",
      "text": "小虎牙就是魅力所在！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000057:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fffa2a773c2e34ceb32cd551e85c5a1f1d3cb8090b582d045e20347d86b6fd8a",
      "text": "肌肉满满！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000058:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09d635dfe253308437db193e851942461583a6fddeaad720ad5c561a22fecac4",
      "text": "不向厄运低头！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c01244cc33521d7b64ad07b1341ce258784dfadc420d3771f63167087a3a55a",
      "text": "自己夸自己是“魅力所在”吗……\n总觉得怪不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf354f6cbc4ba13e91bc4eb8327b57a02056d343d3d51d3f01b19cd5018e6d6c",
      "text": "嗯，作为我自身的特征很好记。\n很棒的标语！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8c5184ea19b1e63e11a11e2f8c98df01ec07021560dc6873461984ef03c1eb8",
      "text": "哇，完全就是我的心声啊。\n我可不会向厄运低头！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63638aaa11a0e500b9864d20f8853e4e427d6355d80fb63515e33d526ec2efbd",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5f8d74afcb33b95311d480c9e4d284a1b8d19c2841601930aae7c965682cca1",
      "text": "参考刚才的标语，\n我们也试着多思考几条吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeeaae06b824271da0e57837c0d4a356bf3fba4a844c068dfcad6b1d6c674441",
      "text": "说的也是。●●●●プロデューサー，\n等想出几个方案之后，再找你商量商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fb66e877517eba4b6816f120ca9962848f9c17a0653373581ebd661e3c3d9e3",
      "text": "呼……●●●●プロデューサー，\n刚才那遍唱得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e1c68378ff3a9390488ddc3857997906ed7386b3e14e5e9fc31af2e37e80615",
      "text": "非常棒！\n大家的配合默契十足。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ea807b22e9cf1ad89c007934aebe31b791aa753f66883b855a90874d3134a4a",
      "text": "谢啦。\n之前花不少时间深入讨论这首歌果然没白费啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95aa4369801dad5250d643139c599ee065bc752a3aa68bb62a4945b23a7b67ca",
      "text": "是一首从清晨就能让人汲取活力、积极向上的歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4ee21ed76fd0504406dac97871fe23cbd19f7c519b8521a721d6fb10bc24ca7",
      "text": "而且曲调很清爽，非常好记呢！\n忍不住就会跟着哼起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ba0c0521b5eae93a407a5f32b2b3a220d741be02fe970ea7f6900811f0fa12b",
      "text": "歌词里也充满了很多积极向上的信息，\n让人元气满满……真想快点让大家听到啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7412fc3ca28daf3ba91ddc244ee0f1207653597f2ea00ffff8b7033edced5dd9",
      "text": "哈哈，龙。不用着急，距离正式开演还有一周呢。\n在那之前，把各自的课题好好改善改善吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cadf53c1911cbc05995985be9e525d58b12db046dc83cbbf74697569a609717",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n练习时间稍微延长一点没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:983ed0ff110540e2cec048620610b2e21e8056700d08f10bac5bf7c532c81d88",
      "text": "没问题的。\n我也陪大家一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc7b3b9baee24c605474c174c58417feacd10a7a46e121289becdcae4d2cc793",
      "text": "好。那就再从头来一遍！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ccbe7c4aae194d585c5912ec262df8ab2166125e2743eb8a01201126222e6a8",
      "text": "《7 in LIVE！》出演当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9861c719ac8ebdf34b094c8d5aaea01f87346fdddaf7d067226f018c46087d0c",
      "text": "这就是台本吗，相当厚啊。\n龙，怎么样？读得下来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5f7578a1bd8c545962689f936d4049934162e94b4f7cfe405537fd3d5267553",
      "text": "是、是的。非常流畅！\n专业术语和难读的汉字都……学习成果展现出来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eec7972ad7927edc6035d0a4af41e77ecdd867f82d6e00aaaf48f1646cb00e5",
      "text": "不过，可不能大意呢。\n正式开拍前我得多读几遍，做好防范厄运的对策！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3afb3f5ad23a82230d1bda334501c5f590e8ae6b4a8c9c498a10e81f1323a1e",
      "text": "送到英雄先生这里的咨询邮件有很多哦。\n请从这些当中选一条吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fd479d2bebed713fd5a482e1cdb3fe7b0301cd13538d0c31575b75f506b40fa",
      "text": "好的。……“怎样才能长高呢？”\n哈哈，好可爱的问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c847a1fa2e4f8a4177c2153039b841de6218b4232e4f42a64aece96460cb724d",
      "text": "这封是……“我有喜欢的人了，\n但很难鼓起勇气告白”哦，很有青春的气息啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef0f113997ade29cc4d519be8fe411b761139f1fbb86445fe4ce31132fc2037",
      "text": "我事先翻阅了几封，\n里面有很多让人会心一笑的咨询呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c5f6da398e42baff166a68454a58d6e047c7a57835f414f3cd9de2d45fcd5bd",
      "text": "确实……嗯？这封是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e43759ff8cccbee7922449efe78d6a499cecb626f72e01d8f3014a92bff48357",
      "text": "这是……\n作为小孩子承受的烦恼来说，未免太沉重了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99355da503ec8b658fe2ae21d0f0f9a882a80a7cd171e808be7ba905189bfd16",
      "text": "（光是向我咨询这件事，肯定就需要极大的勇气吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e5127102f9a40e7d73e79e5ec424762b1e9e2ec64bda75b4036f970dacf8d85",
      "text": "（现在或许也正独自一人饱受煎熬。\n我想成为这个孩子的支柱）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:474ea2a5a05a8458120d8f7785ac3eb05512c9c5e071c75981ac5d265512ab21",
      "text": "（我想握住这只鼓起勇气伸出的手！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1e7ccb0dee29457c9ac234e931a0c686f5d7559420fc3ca1efba261a30d6ae",
      "text": "英雄先生……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09faaed172ee30f7943545ca5a3d615a74fd6d02db1dd5162e28460ef7faf2ed",
      "text": "看来你已经决定好要回答哪位的咨询了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6b223dcf2f7c19c501466d6ca489ba5c0ed28458e0f1f924a7166ffd7b12d8b",
      "text": "……啊啊。\n●●●●プロデューサー，就决定是这个问题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:899cb8a5786aa7584e2c28efbc56ffd3a42676bc062ed986e88abb563042ee39",
      "text": "我想把这句话传达给这个孩子。\n“没事的，你不是一个人”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35bf8b90312dfff35f4586502c7f95f05b16ffad0b7dbe606302f90f68135c4f",
      "text": "毕竟我就是为了这个，才成为偶像的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b2ae14eb5142058a1d20802a47baf9252887402991406a97941fc566f758137",
      "text": "《7 in LIVE！》播出开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6520ab183ae2344b04c1302b7e4a1d0d8aa903d5511409bc3125c7cda614a1e5",
      "text": "大家，早上好！我们是从今天起担任为期1个月\n主题曲演唱的组合FRAME。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:713e31f6924074e6474e79185413f05a6b7d857ab9ee16811bee95e6366488eb",
      "text": "首先由我开始……闪闪发光的小虎牙是魅力所在！\n我是握野英雄，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0184d1b06e09b37c13a51fa691b8cc6e71beefb933e0bb819a69413bb409fcb",
      "text": "论肌肉绝不输给任何人！\n我是信玄诚司，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c99acc4618dcd6b9ce6e9eb4e22805459e5fd6a9d100f3f3e0120450f2d29a92",
      "text": "无论何种厄运都能用笑容击退！我是木村龙……\n咦、咦？麦克风好像出问题了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd71ee18d2786fec57998ad9054abe9dec727ae0a1a53654331ae4b0631d74cb",
      "text": "（龙，用我的麦克风！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac66fc904943cdbc75ed71ca97f6756f69f1146650d791ca9ffe21cbcc669fbe",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n重新来过……各位，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000105:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c981d373a457764d2958e4f95469d565418423884ba4fa857db2ad10faa3b07b",
      "text": "广告中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66c7bda2e113008c4b9837d300f72c4d7595a27251b07cb6ee7a1214c0092993",
      "text": "呜呜，一开场麦克风就坏掉了……\n彩排的时候明明还好好的～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51fcbb81222931e1e788141e0ca0b57f5a4bfed4eda258b44b057380a01f4e9f",
      "text": "没事的，龙。\n救场的事情就交给我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:daf5b8cb210363d85105cd32918d0649d85a682dd1549128885a87cb575065fa",
      "text": "英雄先生、诚司先生～……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2edf43cd9001b55bb3f31c821f2636e6d2edd4e48560199f7b90704628440493",
      "text": "各位，刚才的团队配合非常棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a94523ea9d102e41be37fa1df2bb1475baef20c0fcf944a73a9cafbf91b4092",
      "text": "马上就要进入新闻资讯环节了。\n诚司先生，接下来就拜托你做好准备了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_h:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c",
      "text": "啊啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edf50819d11184bc1b291a041e362119951343f91355754d115770cf9f6bde85",
      "text": "新闻资讯环节",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff3c5470186ee4146504fc52ce78688fb87c54dbe99f5074d10ff844c14dedd",
      "text": "前自卫官独到的防范对策建议，\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb012822d615a61d95f8b48bc0e42434eb6929fd921f8803b0ca096d89f541d",
      "text": "我的知识能够派上用场真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b5879f1fdf2aae4be8a83136ad4fe58da1198011d22fe5015303320aa240a3",
      "text": "除了刚才介绍的之外，防范对策还有很多。\n请各家各户都采取有效的防范手段。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9377fa2991295edde4a98c1d2fc4e64ef82518a02d594aa092d082d9cf51d45",
      "text": "电视机前的各位观众，为了每天的安全着想，\n请大家再次重新审视一下防范方面的工作吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000043:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a367918c73c15adc5fd4bf80266dcfd51e84da44ae17739cd7ade7886decb96f",
      "text": "天气预报环节",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4228f94b17619eb1587affb57a0256dfda63fbca276fa78f3601ac9fe6bee51",
      "text": "7月到10月的火灾发生起数其实很少。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d35cad1c9db1ef4be6d80752111738ca2373ed2801c5c06b359c7140641e682a",
      "text": "因为是多雨且湿度较高的时期，\n大家很容易掉以轻心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208ef3f554ebc20eea8dce923e7b059c6307fadd4c89cf854e017cf31f02e9d7",
      "text": "但为了能够从容应对各种突发情况，\n请大家务必积极参加防灾训练哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000062:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60dfb457ee0a72483c0d53b9508e4d399b62c932bde19b4d1936a2d24d2e3049",
      "text": "烦恼咨询环节",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9facb6ca8efef0e95b37e78d716c09869736abd5f02d822a7a9f0fce4c3029",
      "text": "虽然无法全部回答，但非常感谢大家送来的\n那么多来信！最后请容我传达这句话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d794e477d4ac8c1b3ed86940ea9a8aceb01f2455b9fb530aba7091bf7f6fecb",
      "text": "或许会有感到孤独或不安的时候。\n但是，你们绝对不是孤身一人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076301f38efc920eca52b1be72aa63df157166244483ebf3fda49c0c8502153f",
      "text": "我们无论何时，都是大家的后盾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d56b3670035e0e9955ff1060b3f9bfd45c15488c68654840ea5f912a697eb6c",
      "text": "如果遇上了什么事，希望你们能想起我们。\n一言为定哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5d1f49c88a5863de35bf5df92ecc0aabd0c6a23f20f43782ac1a538ae9cdf56",
      "text": "各位，接下来终于要登台演唱主题曲了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cb467973d365a1b942bd294e9c0eda82c1291af4a69467ef14b38d61c637f7c",
      "text": "到目前为止除了开头的麦克风故障以外，\n完全没有发生厄运呢。今天说不定能顺利结束！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60c8f082b2ab8e5dea33694e766c25ed29d9a2db3084d66d7a2ba89364f7e9b",
      "text": "啊啊。相信为了今天所进行的训练，\n全力以赴去挑战吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:542ec6e7e821b4a9caa8998897c46fb98c5f789bce12d2693f3042cc6e97db59",
      "text": "哦，差不多该出场了。\n●●●●プロデューサー，我们上阵了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9ee91e81a50b6846902989377cd5bc9bbe9df0d3c40f6ccc60c0fc291b74068",
      "text": "接下来就请各位欣赏歌曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0fc4036f578b315249ef28354bc4ddd89a259c4f7c0a8d14df284d6cfcc91d9",
      "text": "本月的主题曲，由FRAME的各位带来的\n《Plus 1 Good Day!》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a92f22f53a9eb16e61663ae6daa72c8bb20082e1f3c8088f2260f5558e6370d",
      "text": "（不管是任何人，都会有心情忧郁的日子吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64c7b4b07500a062467551f7e42e5e66edd963ba6d9e581db78dcb6d79a08faf",
      "text": "（正因如此，才希望大家能听听这首歌）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:753c32c03ad0fbdea19777619d9ba6a6b110ddde7cd81fb3803cab16e30dfc58",
      "text": "（为了能让大家精神饱满地度过这一天，\n融入我们全部的应援去放声歌唱吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cd4738de7559ccea4f20c13cc3a7aa35dd9d0ade80b0d34047c2fd78f2f9da7",
      "text": "谢谢大家的收听！\n那么在最后。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cbe68379e6609bbc4c2badbbaf43b8380256e715a5173687430048e0dfb6be5",
      "text": "收看《7 in LIVE！》的各位观众。\n今天也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f3a13ea12f98630daf4d19b5cbe815a0f4b68ad3a24009f25f318b2c6d60aa",
      "text": "路上小心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e95d77ee53d8b8734d4befd515fb5fd5dfa683cea9b10fdec7d4ae2307519421",
      "text": "《7 in LIVE！》结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ba64883dd265438e55a5d48e89e6c6e4beacb5681376448379c9a6482199fe",
      "text": "哇啊！？手机里收到好多信息……\n这全部都是家里人发来的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d02642b9cff597a89c0c661e360f340db353fefcd0cd64c7e79a508e88a57b7",
      "text": "我也是！\n好像全程都在实时给我播报呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b04dabc91857e5c843bf2cf9ff6b800feb65dc04bc03b7f6e187250707d3adb",
      "text": "各位快看！天音用手机\n把我们唱歌的画面录下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:854fb5e38d8e9e205ccab876b441de021c761b15ae8b5c2528b3c449cda51ea4",
      "text": "拍得很不错哦！看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62886fdef997f0c2904ef528aa14e03fbf668814d671ff87f43aaf77d2541496",
      "text": "那么在最后。收看《7 in LIVE！》的各位观众。今天也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f3a13ea12f98630daf4d19b5cbe815a0f4b68ad3a24009f25f318b2c6d60aa",
      "text": "路上小心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b9fea75d6ccfdd27eadc0b5ba0b8b7ec1d07aebe036aecd55cf6201fa600b79",
      "text": "我出门啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99277047ec754441477cf1734abf019f44cc304b0560f25c965082557d0b1b09",
      "text": "社交平台上同一时间段也有很多\n发表“我出门了！”的内容……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f07e246804c74bdd4dbdbb27eca0ccc740e6accfc8746b50789a676e129ca2bc",
      "text": "看来那是和天音小姐一样，\n回应各位那句“路上小心”的声音呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b38ee96e5179c2d019e671c991e3c219c1521a6c94b1b063216012b4e9d4848",
      "text": "原来是这样吗！？有好多人\n都像天音酱一样给出了回应啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2275f00d41c3df2e291c257d10f8230bef10ee4505c964c1c1a7972d78f466dd",
      "text": "啊啊，只出演今天一天真舍不得啊。\n好想每天都能上节目！对吧，英雄先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12aebf7f1665f55ba5c57967b5bb2c03058d9030ca3c851a52b932e2b6bac120",
      "text": "哈哈，确实是呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2429a5d7a8ee08b666f78a50b2060ec1648a84ac318615c8ad8cee6cb2599cbf",
      "text": "不过，取而代之的是，\n我们的歌声会把这份应援传达到大家身边的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000133:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:811a8bffaaa0462e147b48ed01f3a8b44a2a63cb362ae3942bc54830661155af",
      "text": "……啊，辛苦了。\n现在方便通电话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36d8763be129230017709be0b9b5c43c786674c292c22f1aa636e28928992978",
      "text": "粉丝信里写了让人很高兴的事情。\n我想跟你分享一下，所以就联系你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000145:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a62e7a4ed407533d4b87a856da02e57d759eada41f0cb782c6f8b867122b155",
      "text": "我不是在新闻节目里回答了那个小朋友的咨询吗？\n那个孩子给我回信了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000147:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e799eaf3000f0cc153d3a2cb1702f4e8a7297b88aaa3b85bec06cfd23f94f63",
      "text": "……信上说，那时真的很谢谢你。\n一想到有FRAME在身边，就鼓起了勇气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc0c6010cd1439a3250fbd7e8b31bb0ecac7de9a9599e291622b9c83aeab1a6",
      "text": "所以，对方说已经没事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:178803add29efc4750ac3c1088d737d2187dab768651b892261a391385b62598",
      "text": "你的心意传达到了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf7d44176963ecd8352bb5bfbbcffbb83214d24148c98bdfc5ffd8f06ce1116d",
      "text": "啊啊。能成为那个孩子的支柱我真高兴。\n成为偶像真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c54fc505a0abffe64aea43a044f24b174f717be9eab62bb559c869a218e8cb4",
      "text": "为了能把勇气传达给更多更多的孩子们，\n我会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_k:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2449c084a8f295dac7eeaf9bc2ee509d115bd4738a161b2dd120b980e998dcf",
      "text": "我也去跟信玄和龙汇报一下吧。\n谢谢你听我说这些。回见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
